# wilma settings

Copy this file to `.claude/wilma.local.md` in your workspace root.

## Fields

| Field | Default | Purpose |
| ----- | ------- | ------- |
| `workspace_root` | Auto-detected | Absolute path to workspace root. Leave blank to auto-detect. Set explicitly if your plugin is not installed at `{workspace}/.claude/plugins/wilma/`. |
| `worklog_path` | `wilma/worklog.md` | Path to worklog file, relative to workspace root. |
| `index_path` | `wilma/file-index.md` | Path to file index, relative to workspace root. |
| `backlog_path` | `wilma/backlog.md` | Path to backlog file. |
| `outcomes_path` | `wilma/outcomes.md` | Path to outcomes register. |
| `work_registry_path` | `wilma/work-registry.md` | Path to work registry. |
| `report_output_dir` | `wilma/reports` | Directory where weekly review reports are saved. |
| `exclude_dirs` | `[".claude", ".git", "wilma"]` | Top-level directories never included in the file index. |
| `exclude_paths` | `[]` | Sub-paths exempt from file indexing. |
| `index_exempt_files` | `[]` | Individual filenames never added to the file index. |
| `index_behavior_mode` | `incremental` | File index update mode. `incremental` = append-only, never rewrites. |
| `index_missing_action` | `warn_and_exit` | What to do if the index file is missing when a hook runs. |
| `stale_days` | `14` | Days without an update before a file is considered stale in weekly review. |
| `scan_paths` | `["wilma/"]` | Directories scanned during weekly review. |
| `weekly_review_exclude_paths` | `["wilma/worklog.md", "wilma/file-index.md", "wilma/reports"]` | Paths excluded from weekly review scanning. |
| `new_file_window_days` | `7` | Files created within this many days are considered "new" in weekly review. |
| `orphan_pool_header` | `## Orphaned Pool` | Markdown heading used to locate the orphaned pool section in work-registry.md. |
| `frontmatter_fields` | `[]` | Field names weekly-review checks for completeness. Files missing any of these are flagged. Leave empty to only check for presence of any frontmatter block. |
| `frontmatter_template_path` | `""` | Path to a workspace `.md` file whose frontmatter keys define the required field set. Takes precedence over `frontmatter_fields` if set. |
| `worklog_tracked_fields` | `[]` | Frontmatter fields extracted from each modified file and appended as extra columns in the worklog row. |

## Auto-detection

When `workspace_root` is blank, hook scripts derive the workspace root by walking up from their own location:

```
{workspace}/.claude/plugins/wilma/hooks/scripts/
          ^--- 5 levels up = workspace root
```

This works correctly for standard plugin installation. Only set `workspace_root` explicitly if your directory layout differs.
